<aside class="booking-summary" aria-live="polite"><div class="summary-title"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SHIPPING ESTIMATE</span><span class="subtle-tag">USD</span></div><template x-if="!estimate"><div class="summary-placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="m5 9 11-6 11 6-11 6L5 9Zm0 0v14l11 6 11-6V9M16 15v14"/></svg><h3>A clear price.<br>Before you book.</h3><p>Add countries, weight and dimensions to compare your options.</p></div></template><div x-show="loading" class="estimate-loading">Updating your estimate…</div><p x-show="error" x-text="error" class="estimate-error" role="alert"></p><template x-if="estimate"><div><div class="summary-price"><span x-text="money(estimate.cost)"></span><small x-text="estimate.label"></small></div><div class="summary-journey"><span x-text="origin || originCountry"></span><span>↓</span><span x-text="destination || destinationCountry"></span></div><dl class="price-breakdown"><div><dt>Actual weight</dt><dd x-text="estimate.actualWeight+' kg'"></dd></div><div><dt>Volumetric weight</dt><dd x-text="estimate.dimensionalWeight+' kg'"></dd></div><div class="billable-row"><dt>Chargeable weight</dt><dd x-text="estimate.billableWeight+' kg'"></dd></div><div><dt>Transport</dt><dd x-text="money(estimate.transport)"></dd></div><div><dt>Fuel surcharge ({{ config('shipping.fuel_surcharge')*100 }}%)</dt><dd x-text="money(estimate.fuel)"></dd></div><div x-show="estimate.minimumAdjustment>0"><dt>Minimum price adjustment</dt><dd x-text="money(estimate.minimumAdjustment)"></dd></div><div class="summary-total"><dt>Estimated total</dt><dd x-text="money(estimate.cost)"></dd></div></dl><div class="delivery-estimate"><span>◷</span><div><strong x-text="date(estimate.estimatedDelivery)"></strong><p><span x-text="estimate.days"></span> business days · estimated arrival</p></div></div><p class="summary-notice" x-text="estimate.notice"></p></div></template><div class="summary-help"><strong>How we calculate your price</strong><p>We compare actual and volumetric weight (L × W × H ÷ {{ config('shipping.dimensional_divisor') }}), use the greater value, then round up to the next 0.5 kg under ShipFast’s tariff.</p></div></aside>